nts. Public Health Nutrition. 2012; 15(8):1333-7.</span></p> <p> <span>21. Galbraith-Emami S, Lobstein T. The impact of initiatives to limit the advertising of food and beverage products to children: a systematic review. Obesity Reviews. 2013; 14(12):960\u2013974.</span></p> <h3 class=\\\"section_head1\\\">Disclaimer</h3> <p> <span>The named authors alone are responsible for the views expressed in this document.</span></p> <h3 class=\\\"section_head1\\\">Declarations of interests</h3> <p> <span>Conflict of interest statements were collected from all named authors and no conflicts were identified.</span></p> <div class=\\\"clear\\\"><!-- all clear --></div>", "meta_keywords": "", "og_image": "", "js_rendered": true, "js_message": "Page appears to be rendered by a JavaScript framework; content may be incomplete.", "success": true, "error": "", "truncated": false, "fetched_bytes": 272161, "total_bytes": 272161}}